Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.88,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.97,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.97,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}好想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:18.18,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:18.18,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:21.18,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:21.18,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}好想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.48,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.48,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:27.98,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:27.98,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}好想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:33.61,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}たとえば　きみと僕を二つ足してさ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:33.61,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}如果有一种魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:37.70,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}はんぶんこにちぎる魔法があれば
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:37.70,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}可以将你我相融再一分为二
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:40.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}サヨナラのない永遠になれるのかな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:40.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}是否就可以不再道别互为永远了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:43.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみがいないのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:43.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日你将不在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:46.87,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕は後悔するのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:46.87,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我定会追悔莫及
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:50.17,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}言えなかった言葉たちが
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:50.17,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}那些我欲言无声的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.88,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}棘になって刺さるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.88,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}也会化作荆棘刺向我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:56.13,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみがいないのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:56.13,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日你将不在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:59.30,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕はどうなっちゃうんだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:59.30,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我到底会变成什么模样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:02.51,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}そんな事考えてたら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:02.51,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}越是想着这些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:05.56,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたくなったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:05.56,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}就对你越发思念
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:08.85,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと生きれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:08.85,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日我能与你共度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:11.98,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}毎日記念日にして祝おう
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:11.98,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我将把每一天都当做纪念日去庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:15.07,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}あたりまえにある奇跡を
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:15.07,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}为了不忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:18.20,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}決して忘れはしないように
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:18.20,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}这理所当然的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:21.20,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと生きれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:21.20,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日能与你共度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:24.45,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと話せるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:24.45,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日能与你同语
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:27.21,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと笑えるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:27.21,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日能与你一起欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:30.29,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}って思える　きみと出会えた
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:30.29,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我会这样想  都是因为遇见了你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:36.67,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕は　僕は　きっと幸せものだ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:36.67,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我啊  一定是个幸福的人
